/* ============================================ */
/* Tailwind default color palette (v4)          */
/* Hue x shade tokens + bg/text/border colour utilities. The semantic colours (bg-primary, text-subtle, */
/* border-default…) sit among them, so the colour utilities of a property run in Tailwind's order. */
/* The :root block is derived from Generators~/src/Velvet.StyleTable/PaletteColors.css by Generators~/build.py; */
/* edits made in it are overwritten, and BundledStyleSheetCensusTests fails if it no longer matches that file. */
/* ============================================ */

